      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This bear-sized wolf has white fur and a rime of frost around its muzzle. Its eyes are pale blue, almost white in color.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 19, touch 12, flat-footed 16 (+3 Dex, +7 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 57 [84] (6d10+24)</p><p>Fort +9; Ref +8; Will +4</p><p>Immune Ice</p><p>Weakness Fire</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 50 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +11 (1d8+7 plus 1d6 ice dmg and trip)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Breath weapon (every 1d4+1 rounds, 15-ft. cone, 6d6 ice damage, Reflex half DC 17)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 20, Dex 16, Con 18, Int 6, Wis 15, Cha 10</p><p>Base Atk +6; CMB +12; CMD 25 (29 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Run, Skill Focus (Perception), Weapon Focus (Bite)</p><p>Skills Perception +11, Stealth +4, Survival +5 (+9 scent tracking)</p>"
